      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The LLM (Vultr Serverless Inference)\n\n• reads the recruiter's DM: repo link,\n  red flags, lure score\n• screens the README for prompt injection\n  (nemotron-3.5-content-safety)\n• suggests up to 4 extra steps from\n  the README\n• writes the plain-English explanation,\n  after the verdict is fixed",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The LLM (Vultr Serverless Inference)\n\n• reads the recruiter's DM: repo link,\n  red flags, lure score\n• screens the README for prompt injection\n  (nemotron-3.5-content-safety)\n• suggests up to 4 extra steps from\n  the README\n• writes the plain-English explanation,\n  after the verdict is fixed",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
