      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793817498450,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Guards\n• the README is passed as data, never as instructions; the LLM's extra steps are capped at 4 and run inside the sandbox\n• the LLM's output never feeds the verdict: a prompt-injected README can, at most, make the explanation wrong\n• if Serverless Inference is down, the scan carries on with rules only (tested)\n• a retired model falls back to the next one; a silently swapped model raises an error",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Guards\n• the README is passed as data, never as instructions; the LLM's extra steps are capped at 4 and run inside the sandbox\n• the LLM's output never feeds the verdict: a prompt-injected README can, at most, make the explanation wrong\n• if Serverless Inference is down, the scan carries on with rules only (tested)\n• a retired model falls back to the next one; a silently swapped model raises an error",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
